'''Speedways''' are [[Locations|location]] themed [[wikipedia:Race track|race tracks]] where players can race karts against artificial intelligence (AI), other players, or both. The Kart Racing [[Mini-Games|minigame]] is exclusively for the [[Kart Driver]] [[Job]].

==Tracks==
There are five speedways in [[Sacred Grove]]:
*Tangletrack in [[Briarwood]]
*Frost Ridge in [[Snowhill]]
*Wildwood in [[Sanctuary]]
*Thunder Falls in [[Lakeshore]]
*Sandstorm in [[Seaside]]

All speedways, excluding the Sandstorm Speedway, offer both Kart Racing and Demo Derby which is exclusive for the [[Demo Derby Driver]] Job.
